abstract: >-
  webOwie Proxmox Client is a standalone Linux control-plane client for Proxmox VE.
  The project focuses on controlled, auditable and reproducible infrastructure operations,
  with explicit validation, simulation and rollback boundaries before infrastructure mutations.
